source_status = "PUBLIC: weapon family identity and broad role; see docs/REALISM.md. GAMEPLAY_ESTIMATE: range, speed, effectiveness, salvo behaviour, signature and every other number here is a tuning value. Not a capability claim. A propeller-driven one-way attack drone, modelled as a weapon rather than an aircraft: slow, easy to shoot down, launched in numbers and long-legged enough to be a real nuisance. A generic type, not a specific design."
